B.yH=new A.m(B.e7,["Canal-irrigated belts should prioritize irrigation scheduling by canal turn and avoid late heavy nitrogen before lodging-prone periods.","High heat and salinity pockets require tighter irrigation-water quality checks and stronger whitefly/aphid vigilance in warm spells.","Altitude and valley microclimates can shift pest/disease timing; scout fields frequently after sudden weather changes.","Water-scarce zones benefit from moisture conservation, mulching, and low-frequency deep irrigation rather than frequent light watering.","Short seasons require timely operations and frost-aware planning; prioritize early establishment and protected nurseries where needed.","High rainfall pockets increase foliar disease risk; improve drainage, spacing, and preventive scouting after wet periods."],t.w)
